🌾 Crop Production Data Analysis

📌 Project Overview
This project focuses on analyzing crop production data using Python, Excel, SQL, Tableau, and Machine Learning.

The project includes data cleaning, data preparation, SQL analysis, data visualization, and machine learning.

🎯 Project Objectives
- Clean and prepare the original crop production dataset.
- Organize the cleaned data into separate datasets.
- Analyze agricultural and climate-related data using SQL.
- Create visualizations and dashboards using Tableau.
- Apply Machine Learning to the project data.

